ind":"update","title":"Demo Update 0.9.42: Turkish Text, Co-op Touch and Mac Graphics","summary":"Turkish text, co-op touch controls and Mac graphics fixes Update 0.9.42 improves Turkish text rendering, adds another way to play local co-op and brings together the fixes since our last public Steam build, 0.9.38. Turkish text [*]Added the missing Turkish characters to the game's chunky font, including ş, ğ and İ. [*]Fixed the appearance of Turkish menus and the Pine County welcome banner. Touch controls and local co-op [*]Player 1 can now use touch controls while Player 2 uses a controller in ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-26T05:12:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114043733","verified_at":"2026-10-26T10:15:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3091040-1847286114043021","game_id":"steam-3091040","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 0.9.38: Smoother Mac Startup and Stability Fixes","summary":"0.9.38: smoother Mac startup and stability fixes This update focuses on startup, graphics compatibility and stability across Windows, Mac and Steam Deck/Linux. Mac Fixed long freezes during startup. Fixed texture errors affecting Intel Macs and M2 hardware. Improved intro video playback. Windows Improved startup compatibility on older Intel graphics, including a DirectX 12 fallback. Added clearer driver-update guidance for very old graphics drivers. Added a last-resort graphics mode to help affe","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T21:24:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114043021","verified_at":"2026-10-26T00:22:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3091040-1847286114041160","game_id":"steam-3091040","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 0.9.35: Stability, Controls and Mac Fixes","summary":"Demo 0.9.35 is now live on Windows, Linux / Steam Deck and macOS. This update focuses on crashes, controller handling and a few improvements around the county. Stability and startup Fixed crashes involving the new-game intro, leaving co-op and returning from Credits. Improved startup on lower-end graphics hardware and Macs, including a fix for a Metal texture-format error. Improved Steam Deck Desktop Mode input and kept the fast-quit safeguards. Controls and gameplay Added a clearer pause prompt","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T03:48:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114041160","verified_at":"2026-10-25T07:46:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3091040-1847286114038114","game_id":"steam-3091040","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Steam Deck Startup and Exit Improvements","summary":"This demo update improves startup on Steam Deck and fixes an issue when exiting the game. Implemented specific Steam Deck caching for shaders to improve loading speed by 80%. Fixed an issue that could leave the demo running after selecting Quit. Improved first-launch loading on Steam Deck. Verified that saves remain intact after saving and quitting. Thanks for playing and sharing your feedback!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T22:16:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114038114","verified_at":"2026-10-23T22:32:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3091040-1847286114035191","game_id":"steam-3091040","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 0.9.34: Better Co-op, Cargo Handling and Faster Exits","summary":"This demo update gives your co-op partner more to do, makes loading and rescuing cargo less awkward, and fixes the long wait when quitting on Steam Deck. Haul together Player 2 can drive a separate vehicle, load and strap cargo, and use their own phone and roadside assistance. New careers with two players go straight to the side-by-side courier setup. Player 2's name and appearance are remembered for the next session. Each player has their own aiming dot and controller prompts. Delivery results ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T06:39:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114035191","verified_at":"2026-10-23T11:43:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3091040-1847286114028311","game_id":"steam-3091040","kind":"update","title":"Demo update 0.9.32: better co-op, controls and cargo fixes","summary":"Thanks to everyone trying the Haul Yeah! demo and sharing your feedback. Demo update 0.9.32 is now available for Windows, macOS and Linux, including Steam Deck. {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46496396/6094ba41c86067f35fcb6148722c7d17edfb5f3a.gif Easier to play together Added a Play together entry to the main menu, with clearer hints when a second controller connects. Improved Steam Remote Play controller handling, including duplicate Steam Input devices and reconnecting controllers. Both players can create ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T10:12:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114028311","verified_at":"2026-10-21T11:07:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3091040-1847286114028000","game_id":"steam-3091040","kind":"announcement","title":"Haul Yeah! Live: Loading, Strapping, Delivering","summary":"Haul Yeah! is a delivery-driving sandbox where packing the truck is half the job. Every parcel is a physics object you pick up, stack and strap down, then drive across Pine County through rain, snow and rough back roads.Watch live gameplay from Moonjump, an independent studio in Canberra. The game is out on PlayStation 5 and PC on 16 December 2026, and the free demo is live on Steam now.Wishlist Haul Yeah! on Steam: https://store.steampowered.com/app/3091040/Haul_Yeah/PlayStation 5 store page: h","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T08:23:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114028000","verified_at":"2026-10-21T11:07:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3091040-1846651706693515","game_id":"steam-3091040","kind":"update","title":"Demo update 0.9.28: cargo fixes, mirrors and easier bug reporting","summary":"Thanks to everyone playing the Haul Yeah! demo and sending feedback. This update brings fixes for deliveries, controls and stability, plus an easier way to send us useful logs if something goes wrong. {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46496396/6094ba41c86067f35fcb6148722c7d17edfb5f3a.gif Deliveries and controls Pausing the game no longer damages your cargo. Numpad Enter now works wherever Enter is accepted. Truck mirrors now draw immediately and keep updating while visible, including when viewed from outside t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T03:01:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706693515","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3091040-1846651706689010","game_id":"steam-3091040","kind":"update","title":"Demo update 0.9.27 is live: menu fixes and better diagnostics","summary":"Thanks to everyone trying the Haul Yeah! demo and sharing feedback. Some of you reported a laggy main menu or trouble getting into the game. Demo update 0.9.27 is now live for Windows, macOS and Linux, including Steam Deck. What changed Reworked startup preparation so the main menu opens over the moving world, rather than a frozen background. Improved loading and save-menu handling to keep menu interactions responsive. Added stability checks for empty texture updates and callbacks to objects tha","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T06:49:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706689010","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3091040-1846651706687083","game_id":"steam-3091040","kind":"announcement","title":"The Haul Yeah! demo is out, let's get hauling!","summary":"The Haul Yeah! demo is now available! Watch: Haul Yeah! demo on Steam Deck Stack your cargo, tighten those straps and head out on your first deliveries. We hope you have a great time exploring the county, and finding out just how much you can squeeze onto your truck. Play on your PC, or take it on the roadThe demo supports Windows, macOS and Linux. Got a Steam Deck? It’s been running beautifully in our testing, and we’d love to hear how it plays for you too. Let us know how your deliveries goAs ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T14:26:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706687083","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3091040":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:15:53Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:15:52Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3091040":"2026-10-26T10:15:53Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3091040":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:15:52Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:15:52Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"